The '''Jakku Transport''' was a model of [[transport]] ships.<ref name="SWKids">{{SWKidsYouTube|series=Star Wars By the Numbers|text=Every Ship in the Star Wars Sequel Trilogy|video=bb3vhWXClTY|nolive=1}}</ref> In [[34 ABY]], a [[Starship|ship]] of this model departed from [[Niima Outpost]] on [[Jakku]], before the settlement was [[Escape from Jakku|attacked]] by the [[First Order]].<ref name="Ep7">{{Film|VII}}</ref>

